===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yue}} {{term|雜碎||mixed and broken|tr=zaap6seoi3|lang=yue|sc=ZHchar}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{US}} A [[stir-fry]] vegetable dish, served with pieces of beef or pork in a semi-thick sauce, and often soy sauce.
# {{Canada|and|UK}} Steamed [[beansprout]]s served in a semi-thick sauce, and mixed with a choice of meat and/or vegetables.

